<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were</p>
<p>called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX June gold - up $0.50 to $1.00 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX July silver - up 1.00 to 2.00 cents</p>
<p>NYMEX July platinum - flat to up $0.50</p>
<p>NYMEX June palladium - off $1.00</p>
<p>COMEX July copper - up 1.10 to 1.40 cents per lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
